{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:35:42.678Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c9ec588760e6210427fb8e43c94c0d4566f162c8e3e0de67a58f99427d865e6f","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests support. They usually say \"Gideon's biggest account\" or \"Nadia's old industrial account\" instead of using names, so some of this is inferred from context.\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until the handoff. The 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\". The 5/4 digest says it was reassigned in the CRM effective 2026-05-04. After that date the digests call it Gideon's (8/3: \"Gideon's biggest account\").\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The digests have called it Gideon's fleet account since at least 2025-03. The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, which is odd, but the owner is Gideon either way.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, probably. The 9/30 digest lists \"Gideon's medical account\" as an open item, and Orlavine is the only medical account in the pod. A March 2025 digest called it Nadia's medical account, but no digest gives a handoff date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. They only call it the pod's \"outdoor/retail account\". The 9/30 digest has Nadia hosting a gate-clerk training for it, but that doesn't show ownership. Please confirm it in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nVantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04. One caveat: the undated cheat sheet still says \"Nadia's industrial account\" for Vantorre Group. I treated that as stale because the dated digests are later and say otherwise.\n\nThe digests are not a system of record. If this is going to the board, check the owners against the CRM.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:35:42.831Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c09c24ad8efaa35570b61f037e90a5720040107845b0c40f7db53a03996d894e","actor":null,"via":"runner","tool":"gbrain.ingest","kind":"admin","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","author":"assistant","source":"channel-strategic-pod"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"fact_id":"2","source":"channel-strategic-pod","latency_ms":153,"status":"inserted"}}
{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:35:46.904Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"873e8eb5ce399553271a287c33ec8e22107b541ecf9b39cda5daea12ba91968e","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04, moving from Nadia Fennimore to Gideon. Moss's 5/3 and 5/4 digests both give that date.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Probably Gideon. The 9/30 digest mentions \"Gideon's medical account\", and Orlavine is the only medical account in the pod. A March 2025 digest called it Nadia's, and none of the digests gives a handoff date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner, so I said so rather than guess. I asked Ruth to confirm it in the CRM.\n\nThe digests rarely use names, so most of these owners are inferred from phrases like \"Gideon's fleet account\". The undated cheat sheet still calls Vantorre Group \"Nadia's industrial account\". I treated that as out of date because the dated digests say otherwise. I also told Ruth to check the owners against the CRM before they go on a board slide.\n\nI read only what Ruth can see herself: the #strategic-pod channel and the team's public digests."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
